{"2953570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Survivors", "steam_appid": 2953570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1770457520\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras_big/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1770457520 width=800 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Slime Survivors&quot; – Survive the Limitless Monster Onslaught!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As endless hordes of demons swarm like tidal waves, you’ll become a hero of the Slime Kingdom, upgrading <strong>diverse weapons</strong> to forge instruments of carnage! Dodge through bullet-hell barrages, unleash dazzling ultimate skills to shred enemy waves, and experience an adrenaline-pumping roguelike survival frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do: Move your character, aim at enemies, evade attacks, collect rewards, power up, and slaughter foes in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ <strong>Thrilling Combat Mastery</strong> ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transformative weapon upgrade system turns your humble beginnings into apocalyptic god-slaying artillery! Every level-up brings explosive power growth—witness the miracle of a nobody becoming an apocalyptic force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ <strong>Push Your Limits</strong> ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Strategize! Survive! Find loopholes in increasingly chaotic bullet-hell storms and break through suffocating waves with precision. Every second you survive is a triumph of skill and luck! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >√ <strong>Endless Variety</strong>: Mix and match dozens of weapons and gear<br>√ <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong>: A full-screen spectacle of explosive effects.<br>√ <strong>Challenging Mayhem</strong>: Strike a perfect balance between dodging and slaying your enemies.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1770457520\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras_big/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1770457520 width=800 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Slime Survivors&quot; – Survive the Limitless Monster Onslaught!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As endless hordes of demons swarm like tidal waves, you’ll become a hero of the Slime Kingdom, upgrading <strong>diverse weapons</strong> to forge instruments of carnage! Dodge through bullet-hell barrages, unleash dazzling ultimate skills to shred enemy waves, and experience an adrenaline-pumping roguelike survival frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do: Move your character, aim at enemies, evade attacks, collect rewards, power up, and slaughter foes in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.poster.avif?t=1770457520\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.webm?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.mp4?t=1770457520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ <strong>Thrilling Combat Mastery</strong> ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transformative weapon upgrade system turns your humble beginnings into apocalyptic god-slaying artillery! Every level-up brings explosive power growth—witness the miracle of a nobody becoming an apocalyptic force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ <strong>Push Your Limits</strong> ◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Strategize! Survive! Find loopholes in increasingly chaotic bullet-hell storms and break through suffocating waves with precision. Every second you survive is a triumph of skill and luck! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >√ <strong>Endless Variety</strong>: Mix and match dozens of weapons and gear<br>√ <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong>: A full-screen spectacle of explosive effects.<br>√ <strong>Challenging Mayhem</strong>: Strike a perfect balance between dodging and slaying your enemies.</p>", "short_description": "《Slime Survivors》 is a vibrant bullet-hell hack-and-slash game where you cut through monster hordes, collect rewards to upgrade your weapons, and become an apocalyptic force on the Slime continent.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/d399b14a46cc03d8d53cfe290faba08863cca864/header.jpg?t=1770457520", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/e9fe8c32cc67992e62b2472c27a5256573d9ea3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770457520", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/e9fe8c32cc67992e62b2472c27a5256573d9ea3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770457520", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMDFX-6300/3rdor4thgeni3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX660Ti/HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</str